{"pageid":4036,"title":"Snowy Peaks","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Snowy Peaks</span>","revid":21065,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Snowy Peaks</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Snowy_Peaks_Thumbnail.png/revision/latest?cb=20250429163326\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Snowy Peaks Thumbnail\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Snowy_Peaks_Thumbnail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250429163326\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Snowy_Peaks_Thumbnail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250429163326 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Snowy_Peaks_Thumbnail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250429163326 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Snowy Peaks Thumbnail\" width=\"270\" height=\"142\" data-image-key=\"Snowy_Peaks_Thumbnail.png\" data-image-name=\"Snowy Peaks Thumbnail.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Snowy Peaks</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Resources</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.45.0\" title=\"Version 1.45.0\">1.45.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<b>Snowy Peaks</b> is a mountainous region between the <b>Taiga</b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands</a></b> Biomes. <b>Snowy Peaks</b> has mostly the same resources as what's in the <b>Taiga</b>, main differences are the inclusion of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Icestone\" title=\"Icestone\">Blue Ice</a></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Snow\" title=\"Snow\">Snow</a></b>, the other difference being the snow on the tree leaves, but this doesn't effect the value of the tree.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 264px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Unknown_pedestal_at_snowy_peaks.png/revision/latest?cb=20250815183138\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Unknown pedestal at snowy peaks\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Unknown_pedestal_at_snowy_peaks.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/264?cb=20250815183138\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"264\" height=\"140\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Unknown pedestal at snowy peaks.png\" data-image-key=\"Unknown_pedestal_at_snowy_peaks.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Unknown_pedestal_at_snowy_peaks.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>At the start of Snowy Peaks is a small cave that leads you to the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Unknown_Person\" title=\"Unknown Person\">Unknown Person</a></b> for the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card Quest.</a></b>\n</p><p>On top of a mountain contains the <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Shrine\" title=\"Heavenly Shrine\"><b>Heavenly Shrine</b></a>, a sundial and compass mechanism that is only active during <b>Fridays and saturdays</b>, which serves as the primary method of spawning the <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Tree\" title=\"Heavenly Tree\"><b>Heavenly Tree</b></a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830132912\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.728      1 Template:Buildings\n100.00%   34.728      1 -total\n-->\n